# Web3Forms access key for the contact form (client-side, PUBLIC key — safe to expose).
# 1. Get a free key at https://web3forms.com (enter the destination email; the key is emailed to you).
# 2. Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key below (real `.env` is gitignored).
# 3. For production, add the same variable in Vercel:
#    Project → Settings → Environment Variables → VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY
# Without this key, the contact form will show an error and ask visitors to email directly
# (it will NOT falsely report success).
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
